Could we get a ruling on what level 6, 7 and beyond heads should
be called in LaTeX 2.09? This is related to what they should be
called in LaTeX 3.0, but not inexorably linked (i.e., it would be
nice if they're going to have the same names in both versions,
but if LaTeX 3 completely changes naming of sectioning commands,
then I'd rather have it be more consistent with today's
interface).

